  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://assets.lieonstudios.dev/common/badges/label/lieon-studios-creation.svg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fhttps%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252fmore-stick-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/More-Stick-Variants/badge/requires-mstv.svg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<img width=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.lieonlion.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/pnk2u/More-Fishing-Rod-Variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpnku\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a>\n<sup><img width=\"5\" height=\"8\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/shared/pres/icon/separator_v.svg\">pnku:</sup>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.pnku.de%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/shared/pres/icon/pnku_de_logo.svg\" alt=\"pnku.de\"></a>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/shared/pres/desc_hr_top.svg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>Больше вариантов удочек</h1>\n<p>Рыбалка и езда на свиньях или страйдерах — но так, как хотите вы!<br>\nК какой <em>жерди</em> привязать <em>леску</em> и, возможно, прикрепить <em>морковку</em> или <em>искажённый гриб</em> — теперь это <strong>ваш</strong> выбор!</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/More-Fishing-Rod-Variants/pres/mr_desc_banner.png\" alt=\"\"> Пейзаж на пляже, демонстрирующий несколько недавно добавленных предметов <em>Удочки</em> и <em>Морковки/Искажённого гриба на палке</em>, собранный с помощью модов '<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-armor-stand-variants%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Больше вариантов манекенов</a>' и '<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farmor-stands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Манекены</a>' (для расстановки) от <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fRoundaround\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">roundaround</a>.</p>\n<h2>Добавляет в Minecraft 11 новых видов <em>удочек</em>, 11 новых предметов <em>морковки на палке</em> и 11 новых предметов <em>искажённого гриба на палке</em>.</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/More-Fishing-Rod-Variants/pres/cf_desc_pres_banner.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/zear1.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Текстуры бледного дуба от <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/hunnycakehorse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><em>hunnycakehorse</em></strong></a></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/shared/pres/desc_hr_bottom.svg\" alt=\"\"></p>",
